sequenceDiagram
  participant API as Controller / Service
  participant Q as BullMQ queue (Redis)
  participant W as Worker (@Processor)
  participant X as External service
  API->>Q: queue.add("send", data, attempts 3)
  API-->>API: Respond 202 immediately
  Q->>W: Deliver job
  W->>X: Do slow work
  alt success
    W-->>Q: completed
  else failure
    W-->>Q: failed, retry with backoff
    Q->>W: Redeliver job
  end
